  {
   "id": "c5ef5cfb3099f271",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1030,
   "y": 1340,
   "width": 968.0000000000001,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1603522945,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1837162109,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One command, one database transaction, three places: the Subscription aggregate\n(PrepareDelivery: the delivery is ready, the next one is scheduled), Order (charge,\npaid order) and Product (stock check and reservation). The card charge is outside\nthe database: a rollback cannot undo it.\nIn the seminar 4 code Order and Product are still plain KoFI data models; they become aggregates in seminar 5.",
   "originalText": "One command, one database transaction, three places: the Subscription aggregate\n(PrepareDelivery: the delivery is ready, the next one is scheduled), Order (charge,\npaid order) and Product (stock check and reservation). The card charge is outside\nthe database: a rollback cannot undo it.\nIn the seminar 4 code Order and Product are still plain KoFI data models; they become aggregates in seminar 5.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "076d490ae25f4b1c",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2240,
   "y": 2030,
   "width": 563.2,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1718165849,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 873750152,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Until the customer decides, the delivery stays due\nand the daily run retries it; an incomplete order is never sent.",
   "originalText": "Until the customer decides, the delivery stays due\nand the daily run retries it; an incomplete order is never sent.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "14a0b00bb835e8a5",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2410,
   "width": 3900,
